### 1. 注册学生
POST http://localhost:9191/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userNo=3125008888&name=张三&phone=13800138000&password=123456&confirmPwd=123456&role=1

### 2. 登录（获取Token）
POST http://localhost:9191/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userNo=3125008888&password=123456

### 3. 绑定宿舍（把下面的token换成上面登录返回的）
POST http://localhost:9191/api/student/bind
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjbGFpbXMiOnsicm9sZSI6MSwidXNlck5vIjoiMzEyNTAwODg4OCIsInVzZXJJZCI6OH0sImV4cCI6MTc3NDkxNDc0OH0.G1jTzBHWkq2WSagkibyniBnYbLcz6yvXFZLeVWlcOFo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userId=1&building=A栋&room=101

### 4. 创建报修单
POST http://localhost:9191/api/student/create
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjbGFpbXMiOnsicm9sZSI6MSwidXNlck5vIjoiMzEyNTAwODg4OCIsInVzZXJJZCI6OH0sImV4cCI6MTc3NDkxNDc0OH0.G1jTzBHWkq2WSagkibyniBnYbLcz6yvXFZLeVWlcOFo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

studentId=1&deviceType=水龙头&description=漏水严重

### 5. 查看报修记录
GET http://localhost:9191/api/student/repair_history?studentId=1
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjbGFpbXMiOnsicm9sZSI6MSwidXNlck5vIjoiMzEyNTAwODg4OCIsInVzZXJJZCI6OH0sImV4cCI6MTc3NDkxNDc0OH0.G1jTzBHWkq2WSagkibyniBnYbLcz6yvXFZLeVWlcOFo

### 6. 管理员查看报修单详情
GET http://localhost:9191/api/admin/orderinformation?orderId=1
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJjbGFpbXMiOnsicm9sZSI6MSwidXNlck5vIjoiMzEyNTAwODg4OCIsInVzZXJJZCI6OH0sImV4cCI6MTc3NDkxNDc0OH0.G1jTzBHWkq2WSagkibyniBnYbLcz6yvXFZLeVWlcOFo